{
 "about": "The composer's Stop presence (cmux-motion src/turn_presence.rs and webviews composer/turnPresence.ts). Each case starts at time 0 with `start` running, then applies its steps in order: a step with `running` sets it (`immediate`: the person's send), one without only advances the clock. After each step `shown`, `pulses` and `wake` (next_wake, null for none) must match.",
